    "detailed_description": "I've wanted to make my own Rock'n'Roll Racing game since I was a kid.<br>Now I'm making it, just 'cause I Can!<br>What will you do to me - i'm in another city! XD<br><br><strong>Key features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Buy a car. Upgrade it.<br></li><li> Race multiple tracks!<br></li><li> Fight your way to the 1st place!<br></li><li> You have (for now) &quot;6 Barrels of Awesomeness&quot; Minigun, Homing Missiles, Land Mines, Front Bumper Spikes, Nitro Boost and 5 wheels (+ steering one)!<br></li><li> Listen to Awesome Music!<br></li><li> Be happy!</li></ul><br>I'll try to make it as fun as it can be!<br>You may help me with it by playtesting it and giving me a feedback in the game's Steam community or in my social networks.<br>I'll be very greatfull if you'll record your playthrough with your commentaries and send the youtube link to me.<br><br>Make the Battle Racing Games Great Again!<br><br>&quot;Gonochki&quot; means diminutive form of &quot;Racing&quot; in Russian, btw.",
